<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 2500s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 26th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 2500s BCE, 23 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 9 were founded and 0 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Uruk, the Mari and the Elamite Confederation.</p></header>
